{
"file": 798,
"paths": [
"d008/d067/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "0c97bea5",
"en_raw": "You're always here, Gramps"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "9e088b8f",
"en_raw": "aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "0d7a373d",
"en_raw": "You kids come strolling often too"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "b5c4a044",
"en_raw": "Then you must know"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "631164bf",
"en_raw": "this area well?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "2b0759fe",
"en_raw": "To a degree"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "7d2a2545",
"en_raw": "That, um, the one continuing from the station"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "512e4d70",
"en_raw": "that continues from the station?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "e994ff38",
"en_raw": "Do you know what happened"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "171718e3",
"en_raw": "there three or four years ago?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "91e0d213",
"en_raw": "...Sorry, I don't know"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "ed941e02",
"en_raw": "That felt kind of odd..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "e333a75e",
"en_raw": "Thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "c7e91719",
"en_raw": "Hey, just one last time"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "34f461df",
"en_raw": "tell me about the fall accident"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "8b96c681",
"en_raw": "About that, I'm sorry but..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "d7577104",
"en_raw": "That person... was always alone"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "54087316",
"en_raw": "Kurumi heard about the person on the stairs"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "9653f40e",
"en_raw": "Um... what's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "b4e9d762",
"en_raw": "Is it mere curiosity?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "f1c671e5",
"en_raw": "Or else..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "211719e7",
"en_raw": "I just want to know"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "c9a32b5d",
"en_raw": "Is that not okay?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "f4f76645",
"en_raw": "It's not good"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "19009ecd",
"en_raw": "But... now that it's come to this"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "a7f56d54",
"en_raw": "there seems to be no escape"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "d0d2497d",
"en_raw": "Can't be helped, I'll tell what I know"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "b0a25341",
"en_raw": "Wow, Gramps is a good guy"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8c08ab76",
"en_raw": "...One cold winter evening"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b5101b25",
"en_raw": "the student packed a big basket"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "4bf1ff48",
"en_raw": "full of laundry"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "583e4226",
"en_raw": "and tried to go down the stairs..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "2bf21c88",
"en_raw": "But the snow that fell the night before"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "4ad6e472",
"en_raw": "had frozen"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "c685a62c",
"en_raw": "and the stairs were such that"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2209a895",
"en_raw": "you couldn't go up or down without a handrail"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "fa4165f8",
"en_raw": "He slipped, I see..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "f56b943a",
"en_raw": "By the time I saw"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "7ffd6e0f",
"en_raw": "the unfortunate youth had already"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "e4e0128c",
"en_raw": "been thrown to the bottom"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "780dbcad",
"en_raw": "of the stairs..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f16c73e5",
"en_raw": "Hmm, well"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "3935d57c",
"en_raw": "excuse me, but"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "8cbfe2b9",
"en_raw": "that sounds fairly common"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "8908d60b",
"en_raw": "Could you tell us"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "3bf74577",
"en_raw": "the rest of the earlier story?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "3810455d",
"en_raw": "But, starting with me"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "597e5ebe",
"en_raw": "the people present at this incident"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "b8d5d0d1",
"en_raw": "have a reason for not wanting to talk"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "ee46b4b9",
"en_raw": "other than that"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c2c0ea7a",
"en_raw": "What is it...?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "33eace6f",
"en_raw": "Do you know"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "1efafc24",
"en_raw": "the greengrocer's owner?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "5a5b0f7f",
"en_raw": "I do"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "42884845",
"en_raw": "his shop is near my home"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "9b626dc1",
"en_raw": "He was one of those who were there"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "be049ef3",
"en_raw": "Ask him about the first part"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "ec1d8518",
"en_raw": "For the rest, hear it from the greengrocer"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "cff61d77",
"en_raw": "hear him out... then we'll see"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "ecd74083",
"en_raw": "If it's just curiosity"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "5773a696",
"en_raw": "going around asking persistently"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "e69de975",
"en_raw": "you should stop"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "e45381ec",
"en_raw": "Everyone has one or two"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "a1105656",
"en_raw": "things they don't want to talk about"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "dac74c4a",
"en_raw": "He's the greengrocer's owner"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "2181ec53",
"en_raw": "just up this slope"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "9b626dc1",
"en_raw": "He was one of those who were there"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "be049ef3",
"en_raw": "Ask him about the first part"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "f2608671",
"en_raw": "I understand, that's enough now"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "e333a75e",
"en_raw": "Thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "2904699d",
"en_raw": "It seems you couldn't"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "c2e1d450",
"en_raw": "hear it from the greengrocer"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "cc8f49ac",
"en_raw": "Actually everyone knows"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "fa262e39",
"en_raw": "and seems to have seen it"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "b919058f",
"en_raw": "but when you dig a bit deeper"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "5813d5c4",
"en_raw": "they say, about that..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "30ae1abd",
"en_raw": "What's going on?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "c197c619",
"en_raw": "That's just how it is"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "e9d2e142",
"en_raw": "I don't get it at all"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "677eb365",
"en_raw": "Maybe everyone regrets it"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "d92ec773",
"en_raw": "...Regret? Why?"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "7ef38f8d",
"en_raw": "Listen, student"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "bd9589a3",
"en_raw": "he was alive"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "2edf16e3",
"en_raw": "Wasn't it a fatal fall?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "3003cd0e",
"en_raw": "Of course it was"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "05196e8e",
"en_raw": "Hey, please"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "b13fed25",
"en_raw": "explain so even a middle schooler"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "7bfee8b2",
"en_raw": "can understand"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "5c88c16b",
"en_raw": "What a calamity today"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "abef1e87",
"en_raw": "...That one can't be saved anymore"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "7f9f238e",
"en_raw": "At a glance, everyone knew right away"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "cb33ca4c",
"en_raw": "Neck broken, head split"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "3611aa39",
"en_raw": "Then before long"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "68a0c59b",
"en_raw": "a crowd gathered around the student"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "f0c24c85",
"en_raw": "Worst, gawkers"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "0a611a11",
"en_raw": "...But then"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "f20128bc",
"en_raw": "he suddenly stood up"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "52edcf1d",
"en_raw": "and to us who were watching"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "26778bee",
"en_raw": "he begged for help..."
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "f2d645f7",
"en_raw": "But we were in no state"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "f3f0602e",
"en_raw": "to help anyone"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "71b1bdd6",
"en_raw": "Everyone fled in fear,"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "0cf3c249",
"en_raw": "the wives screamed,"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "0e1b262b",
"en_raw": "dogs barked, it was chaos"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "bf457136",
"en_raw": "Nobody lent a hand"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "830bdbb7",
"en_raw": "Could you have done something?"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "a21351f2",
"en_raw": "That's... true"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "04f80bbe",
"en_raw": "About the earlier story"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "64620ee6",
"en_raw": "Then, abruptly,"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "21727b85",
"en_raw": "the police came"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "d5c595a5",
"en_raw": "The police are well practiced"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "7b9fb56f",
"en_raw": "unfazed, they radioed at once"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "1754cd37",
"en_raw": "Quite different from us"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "011cd80c",
"en_raw": "who ran around and watched..."
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "0ec2b85b",
"en_raw": "...Sorry about that"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "a44f88dd",
"en_raw": "No, it's fine"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "1608bbc5",
"en_raw": "Anyway, what's frightening"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "75ced1fc",
"en_raw": "isn't dying"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "2bb61dd3",
"en_raw": "At my age there's"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "8857903f",
"en_raw": "hardly anything frightening"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "c4fe2f4c",
"en_raw": "but that one thing..."
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "fb40e7a0",
"en_raw": "What frightening thing?"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "56049d39",
"en_raw": "Why, young one"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "6f2af20c",
"en_raw": "...the loneliness at the moment of death"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "40f5a1b5",
"en_raw": "This is Dusk Slope..."
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "727225f6",
"en_raw": "Strange things happen often"
}
]
}